  },
  {
   "boss": "p8",
   "text": "Big ogre; pull trash away from him and use ranged to take down his shamans."
  },
  {
   "boss": "p17",
   "text": "Heavy tank-and-spank with adds; clear them as they appear."
  }
 ],
 "notes": "The walking order of floors is uncertain: the journal numbers floors 1..6 but I do not know the real order, so the route is by floor number, not by a tested clear. Emberseer and the rest of Upper are in upper-blackrock-spire. uiMapIDs 250 verified (ATT 229 -> map 250), 251..255 inferred. Coordinates come from OpenMap (MIT), AllTheThings or web guides only; spots those lack are null. NeedRoll (GPL-3.0) was used only to cross-check; no values were copied."
